{
  "id": 89484442,
  "iid": 2195,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "MUX27010: correct info field decoding when  EA bit is zero",
  "description": "Update packet-mux27010.c following the correct interpretation of the EA bit from the specs https://www.3gpp.org/ftp/tsg_t/tsg_t/tsgt_04/docs/pdfs/TP-99119.pdf#page=18 where it is described the case of info field bigger than 127 bytes:\n1. the first octet stores the first 7 LSB bits\n2. the second octet stores the other 8 MSB bits (see pg. 18).\n\n![EA_Bit](/uploads/e93d45fa84a16d3d15a2e3d6b92b9cee/EA_Bit.png)",
